      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3487196714765767374, guid: 16c09219c4948dd4b955aa8140daf469, type: 3}
      propertyPath: PaperText.GlocText
      value: "*\u201CAfter studying the inscriptions around the tree, I finally began
        to understand their meaning. These characters provide an important clue\u2014a
        clue to the location of the legendary seed. With the combination of these
        ancient characters, I managed to formulate two maps that will guide anyone
        who follows their instructions. I kept one map for myself, while the spare
        map I kept safely in a locked chest. The code to open the chest is the key
        to the cardinal directions: North, South, West and East. Each direction has
        a number representing an inscription around the mysterious tree.\""
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
