    - target: {fileID: 3487196714765767374, guid: 16c09219c4948dd4b955aa8140daf469, type: 3}
      propertyPath: PaperText.GlocText
      value: "*\"My name is Windra Bramudara, after years of hearing myths about
        the forest around Mount Galunggung, I finally came across an old tree which
        was said to hold a secret. A towering banyan tree with inscriptions written
        in ancient script around it. These characters are inscribed in a seemingly
        deliberate arrangement, facing the banyan tree with placement according to
        the cardinal directions. So far, no one has been able to conclude the meaning
        of these characters. I'm sure this script holds clues, perhaps about the
        legend of Siki Kahuripan. I also wrote down every character visible in these
        four inscriptions. Each one is placed in a different direction, and I feel
        like this is no coincidence.\u201D"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3487196714765767374, guid: 16c09219c4948dd4b955aa8140daf469, type: 3}
